          %h3#Cech2Cocycles Cech cocycles
          %p
            The discussion above of
            = succeed "-principal" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi G
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G
            = succeed "s" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lie+groupoid"} Lie groupoid
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                    %mi B
                  %mi G
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{B}G
            and
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                    %mi E
                  %mi G
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{E}G
            that are canonically induced by a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lie+group"} Lie group
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi G
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi G
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G
            is generalized to a
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lie+2-group"} Lie 2-group
            = succeed "s" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-morphism"} 2-morphism
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/principal+2-bundle"} principal 2-bundle
            = succeed "s" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gerbe"} gerbe
            = succeed "s." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bundle+gerbe"} bundle gerbe
          %p
            Write
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi U
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 1
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo =
                  %mi ℝ
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                  %mi ℤ
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} U(1) = \mathbb{R}/\mathbb{Z}
            for the
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/circle+group"} circle group
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                    %mi B
                  %mi U
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 1
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{B}U(1)
            obtained from this. But since
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi U
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 1
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} U(1)
            is an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/abelian+group"} abelian group
            this groupoid has the special property that it still has itself the structure of an
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/group+object"} group object
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2-group"} 2-group
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/delooping"} delooping
            once more to arrive at a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lie+2-groupoid"} Lie 2-groupoid
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
