                    %mn 1
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{\flat}_{dR} \mathbf{B}^n U(1)
              an equivalent one that does comes from a globally defined form.
          .num_lemma
            %h6#observation_6 Observation
            %p
