              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/universal+principal+infinity-bundle"} universal 2-bundle
          .num_remark
            %h6#remark_8 Remark
            %p
              For emphasis, notice that this span is governed by a presheaf of diagrams that over
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi U
                    %mo ∈
                    %mi CartSp
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} U \in CartSp
              is of the form
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mrow
                      %mtable
                        %mtr
                          %mtd
                            %mi U
                          %mtd
                            %mo →
                          %mtd
                            %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                              %mi B
