              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/connection+on+a+bundle"} connection on a bundle
              in that it factors through the inclusion
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
