            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/connection+on+an+%E2%88%9E-bundle"} ∞-connections
            among these pseudo-connections. From the point of view of the general abstract theory these are particularly nice representatives of more intrinsically defined structures.
          %p
