            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/twisted+cohomology"} twisted
            differential string structures etc. (
            %a{:href => "http://nlab.mathforge.org/schreiber/show/differential+cohomology+in+an+(%E2%88%9E%2C1)-topos+--+references#SSSIII"}> SSSIII
            ).
          %h2#summary Summary
          %p This section gives a concise summary of the constructions introduced above.
          %h3#for_connections_on_principal_1bundles
            For connections on
            = succeed "-principal" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi G
